msgctxt "124"
msgid "You... You'll pay for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Pshaw. Should've just minded your own business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"(I'm supposed to be looking for Jinsei...)\r\n"
"Say, you wouldn't happen to have had a place up on Suppon\r\n"
"Street once upon a time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Yep, sure did. Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Somebody's been looking for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Probably some debt collector wanting to shake me down. Tell\r\n"
"'em to leave me alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"(I found the bar⑬for what it's worth. Guess I should go\r\n"
"tell the old man in front of the Millennium Tower.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I told you, gimme back the cash! All's you got left of value\r\n"
"in that house of yours is that fancy Buddhist altar...\r\n"
"So you best be sayin' your prayers we don't take that too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Why you... snot-nosed punk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Hah, if I'm a snot-nosed punk, then what does that make you,\r\n"
"borrowing money from one? A stuffy old geezer, that's what!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"This ain't the last you've heard from me. You better cough\r\n"
"up all the money next time, or you'll be coughin' up blood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Dirty rascal... Hey, what are you looking at?"
msgstr ""

